\f0\fs24 \cf0 ADDING A NEW PROJECT\
\
1.\uc0\u8288  \u8288 Open page.tsx under TomWebsite/src/app/page.tsx\
\
2.\uc0\u8288  \u8288 Add new Projects to be displayed in the front page by editing the "projects" variable.\
\
3.\uc0\u8288  \u8288 Add the title, image, and the slug. NOTE: The cover images must be placed under TomWebsite/public/portfolio. Don't forget to add the extension! (.jpg or .png)\
\
\
ADDING DATA FOR A NEWLY CREATED PROJECT\
\
1.\uc0\u8288  \u8288 Add a new folder for each of the newly created projects under TomWebsite/public/ with all the stills you want to display for that project.\
\
2.\uc0\u8288  \u8288 Add new Project Data for each of the /work pages by editing the page.tsx file under TomWebsite/src/app/work[slug]/page.tsx Make sure the title of each project matches what you previously defined in "slug".\
\
	2.1 Edit the "projectFolders" variable and add the new folder you created in step 1., making sure it matches the exact name.\
\
	2.2 Edit the "projects" variable and add the rest of your project data: Title, Director, Youtube link, etc.\
\
	2.3 Add the number of images to look for in the "imageCounts" variable.\
\
\
CHECKING EVERYTHING IN\
\
1.\uc0\u8288  \u8288 Open Fork and check-in your changes by adding a commit message and hitting "Push".}